    <MESSAGE value="Adjust memory and connection management defaults in log engine and SQLite pool&#10;&#10;- Reduced `MAX_SEGMENTS_BEFORE_MERGE` to 10 for smaller merge sizes and improved memory stability on constrained nodes.&#10;- Set log engine memory limit default to 4 GiB for safer deployments.&#10;- Increased SQLite connection pool size to 8 and cache size to 16 MB per connection for better API concurrency.&#10;- Extended SQLite busy timeout and acquire timeout for smoother handling of high-load scenarios." />
    <MESSAGE value="Adjust memory, merge, and database connection defaults for better performance&#10;&#10;Fine-tuned the `MAX_SEGMENTS_BEFORE_MERGE` to reduce memory spikes during segment merges, added default memory limits for deployments, increased SQLite busy timeout to 10 seconds, adjusted SQLite connection pool to default to 8 with a bounded cache size, and extended connection acquisition timeout to prevent saturation during high concurrent loads." />
    <MESSAGE value="Set 1GB body size limit for Thruster binary uploads  &#10;&#10;Added `DefaultBodyLimit::max(1GB)` middleware to the `/api/method/thruster.upload` route to support large binary uploads." />
