    <MESSAGE value="Add chunked file upload support for Thruster, including backend test case and frontend adjustments" />
    <MESSAGE value="Add a script for chunked Thruster binary uploads&#10;&#10;- Introduced `upload-thruster-chunked.js` to support uploading Thruster binaries via the chunked endpoint.&#10;- Supports environments with a 128 MB route limit by chunking files into 25 MB parts.&#10;- Includes form data handling, progress reporting, and platform validation.&#10;- Facilitates seamless integration with the Sebrus Store using `SEBRUS_SID` for authentication." />
    <MESSAGE value="Introduce chunked upload improvements: enforce file size limits, implement exponential backoff retries, and optimize cleanup of temporary upload directories." />
